<view class="page"><view class="row section"><view><view class="title">我的好物生活</view><view class="small muted">认真拥有，也认真记得。</view></view><view class="profile-mark">物</view></view><view class="section"><view class="menu-row" bindtap="categories"><text>分类与持有上限</text><text>›</text></view><view class="menu-row" bindtap="privacy"><text>数据与隐私</text><text>›</text></view><view class="menu-row" bindtap="openFeedback" role="button"><text>建议与反馈</text><text>›</text></view><view class="menu-row" bindtap="about"><text>关于好物</text><text>›</text></view></view><view class="note section">本地版 · 数据保存在当前设备<view class="line-break"/>照片和记录不会自动同步，请保留备份。</view><button wx:if="{{!demo}}" class="link section" bindtap="demo">添加四件示例物品，体验完整页面</button><button wx:else class="link section" bindtap="removeDemo">移除示例，保留自己的物品</button><view class="build-label">好物 / 每一件，都有自己的故事</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{feedbackOpen}}" class="feedback-overlay"><view class="feedback-dialog" role="dialog" aria-label="建议与反馈"><view class="feedback-title serif">你希望好物变得怎样？</view><scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="feedback-fields"><view class="feedback-label">添加图片<text class="feedback-helper">最多3张</text></view><view class="feedback-photos"><view wx:for="{{feedbackPhotos}}" wx:key="*this" class="feedback-photo"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="feedback-remove" bindtap="feedbackRemovePhoto" data-index="{{index}}" aria-label="删除图片">×</button></view><button wx:if="{{feedbackPhotos.length<3}}" class="feedback-add" bindtap="feedbackAddPhoto" aria-label="添加图片">＋</button></view><view class="feedback-label">反馈内容<text class="required"> *</text></view><textarea class="feedback-text" placeholder="想要的功能、遇到的问题，都可以告诉我。" value="{{feedbackText}}" maxlength="-1" bindinput="feedbackInput"/><view class="feedback-counter">已输入 {{feedbackCount}} 字</view><view class="feedback-label">联系方式</view><input class="feedback-contact" placeholder="希望收到回复，可以留下联系方式" value="{{feedbackContact}}" maxlength="-1" bindinput="feedbackContactInput"/><view class="feedback-local-note">本地预览：提交后仅保存在本机，暂不发送给作者。</view></scroll-view><view class="feedback-actions"><button class="feedback-exit" bindtap="closeFeedback">退出</button><button class="primary" bindtap="submitFeedback">提交反馈</button></view></view></view>